// Sudden death — In the Hall of the Mountain King. The intro accelerates from a sneaking reedy
// pulse (112 bpm) to a stampede; the loop runs at 168 bpm (and the game can push SetTempo on top).
// Original "troll chase" episodes and a chromatic breakdown between statements of the theme.
